184     description: str = (
185         "The plan-related tools. Activate this tool when you need to execute "
186         "complex task, e.g. building a website or a game. Once activated, "
187         "you'll enter the plan mode, where you will be guided to complete "
188         "the given query by creating and following a plan, and hint message "
189         "wrapped by <system-hint></system-hint> will guide you to complete "
190         "the task. If you think the user no longer wants to perform the "
191         "current task, you need to confirm with the user and call the "
192         "'finish_plan' function."
